<h2 class="bde-heading-506-115 bde-heading">
What Is Karl-Anthony Towns’s Salary With the Knicks?
</h2><div class="bde-fancy-container-506-116 bde-fancy-container">
  
  
	



<div class="bde-fancy-container-506-139 bde-fancy-container">
  
  
	



<div class="bde-f-text-506-151 bde-f-text">
<p>Towns earns <strong>$57.08m</strong> in 2026-27, the largest salary at <a href="/teams/new-york-knicks/">New York</a> and the third year of a four-year extension. It rises from <strong>$53.14m</strong> last season.</p>
<p>His career earnings come to <strong>$343.4m</strong> across twelve seasons. The salary is <strong>25.84%</strong> of the club’s <strong>$220.86m</strong> payroll, so a quarter of what New York spends goes to one player.</p>

