<h2 class="bde-heading-506-117 bde-heading">
When Does Karl-Anthony Towns’s Contract Expire?
</h2><div class="bde-fancy-container-506-118 bde-fancy-container">
  
  
	



<div class="bde-fancy-container-506-141 bde-fancy-container">
  
  
	



<div class="bde-f-text-506-154 bde-f-text">
<p>Towns signed a four-year extension worth <strong>$220.44m</strong> with <a href="/teams/minnesota-timberwolves/">Minnesota</a> in 2022, all of it guaranteed. New York took the contract on when it traded for him in October 2024.</p>
<p>It carries a player option on 2027-28 with a June 29, 2027 deadline, and a 10% trade bonus. If he declines the option he reaches free agency in 2027 at 31.</p>

</div><div class="bde-shortcode-506-191 bde-shortcode"><div class="nba-fin" data-nba-fin="proportions">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/_ported/08ba6176394a.css">
