</div><div class="bde-f-text-506-156 bde-f-text">
<p>Towns has a published net worth of around <strong>$100m</strong>, against <strong>$343.4m</strong> in career salary. The gap is what tax and two decades of living take out of a figure like that.</p>
<p>He played one season at Kentucky and Minnesota took him first overall in 2015, four months before he turned 20.</p>

