<script type="application/ld+json" is:inline>{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","@id":"https://nbasalaries.com/players/karl-anthony-towns/#faq","isPartOf":{"@id":"https://nbasalaries.com/players/karl-anthony-towns/"},"mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What Is Karl-Anthony Towns’s Salary With the Knicks?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Towns earns $57.08m in 2026-27, the largest salary at New York and the third year of a four-year extension. It rises from $53.14m last season. His career earnings come to $343.4m across twelve seasons. The salary is 25.84% of the club’s $220.86m payroll, so a quarter of what New York spends goes to one player."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What’s Next for Karl-Anthony Towns Beyond 2026?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"A player option on 2027-28 follows this season, and he can decline it by June 29, 2027. Declining it would put him in free agency at 31."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How Much Does Karl-Anthony Towns Earn Over Time?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"A $57.08m season is hard to picture, so here's what it comes to over smaller stretches of time."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"When Does Karl-Anthony Towns’s Contract Expire?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Towns signed a four-year extension worth $220.44m with Minnesota in 2022, all of it guaranteed. New York took the contract on when it traded for him in October 2024. It carries a player option on 2027-28 with a June 29, 2027 deadline, and a 10% trade bonus. If he declines the option he reaches free agency in 2027 at 31."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How Much Is Karl-Anthony Towns’s Net Worth Today?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Towns has a published net worth of around $100m, against $343.4m in career salary. The gap is what tax and two decades of living take out of a figure like that. He played one season at Kentucky and Minnesota took him first overall in 2015, four months before he turned 20."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Why Is Karl-Anthony Towns on a Maximum Deal?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Towns is paid $57.08m because the designated veteran rules let a club pay one player 35% of the cap, and he qualified by making an All-NBA team. He has been paid by two clubs in twelve seasons and has earned $343.4m."}}]}</script>
